          {
            "typeName": "dsDescription",
            "multiple": true,
            "typeClass": "compound",
            "value": [
              {
                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "The Excel file contains the raw data for this article. It is organised per figure panel. <ul>\n<li>Figure 1B: contains the data for communal egg-laying preference, ranging from avoidance (<0) to attraction (>0), based on whether eggs were laid on side A (pheromones) or side B (solvent).</li>\n<li>Figure S1A: provides the raw data on the total number of eggs per line and replicate.</li>\n<li>Figure 2B: contains the data for the time to laying of the first egg in a group.</li>\n<li>Figure 2C: shows the percentage of first eggs laid at night (0 indicates day and 1 indicates night).</li>\n<li>Figure 2E: compares egg-laying latency between single-housed and group-housed females. For each tested line, the data are on the same row. Single flies are in cells C2-AG, and grouped flies are in cells AP-CB.</li>\n<li>Figure S2B: shows the total number of eggs laid during the 24 hours of the experiment.</li>\n<li>Figure 3B: represents the total number of social interactions per line and per replicate.</li>\n<li>Figure 3C: represents the total duration of social interactions per line and per replicate.</li>\n<li>Figure 5A: presents locomotor speed per line and per replicate.</li>\n<li>Figure 5B: presents the time spent in the center of the arena per line and per replicate.</li>\n</ul>\nThere are no data associated with Figures 1A, 2A, and 3A because they contain only illustrations of assays. Figures S1B, 2D, S2B, Figure 4, Figure 5C-J, and Figure 6 represent correlations for which the raw data are provided in the Excel tabs where each individual measure was originally presented."
                },
                "dsDescriptionDate": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionDate",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "2026-03-12"
                }
              }
            ]
